@startuml UC-15
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-15.md
title UC-15: Product Detail
footer Feature CAT-03 | Business rules: BR-10, BR-14, BR-16, BR-17
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest / Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "ProductsController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "ProductService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Open a product
MVC -> API : GET /api/products/{slug}
API -> SVC : GetDetailAsync(slug)
SVC -> DB : Find product by slug WHERE IsActive = 1\n+ active variants + images ORDER BY SortOrder
alt product not found or hidden (BR-10)
  SVC --> API : NotFound
  API --> MVC : 404 Not Found
  MVC --> U : Show "Product not found" page
else found
  SVC -> SVC : Effective price per variant (BR-14)\nStock status per variant (BR-17)\nThumbnail + gallery (BR-16)
  SVC --> API : ProductDetailDto\n(info, variants, images, AverageRating, ReviewCount)
  API --> MVC : 200 OK
  MVC --> U : Show gallery, sizes/colors, price, rating
  U -> MVC : Select size and color
  alt variant out of stock
    MVC --> U : Show variant as unavailable,\ndisable "Add to cart"
  else in stock
    MVC --> U : Show variant price and stock,\nenable "Add to cart" (UC-26)
  end
end

@enduml
